{"duration_api_ms":79487,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c7b510f8-3495-4257-8a64-2d596d75ce59","total_cost_usd":0.5564214,"usage":{"input_tokens":20,"cache_creation_input_tokens":42602,"cache_read_input_tokens":337527,"output_tokens":7401,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":797},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":42602,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":637,"cache_read_input_tokens":44426,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4156,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4156},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":20,"outputTokens":7401,"cacheReadInputTokens":337527,"cacheCreationInputTokens":42602,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5564214,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":797,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":12,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I wrote the plan to `tasks/CAT-05/plan.md`. The story is adopted, so it describes behaviour the shop already has: the plan changes no production code and no existing test, and it doesn't stop to ask a human anything. I didn't run any other stage and didn't run the build.\n\n**What the plan found:**\n- **The behaviour exists.** All five scenarios are in the shared layout `src/DcaShop.Web/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml`. The logo is at `:23` and links to `/`. The \"Home\" and \"Products\" links are at `:26-27`. The footer text is at `:67`, and the \"Event Log\" link to `/backoffice/events` is at `:68`. `_ViewStart.cshtml:2` puts that layout on every page, and no view overrides it.\n- **No test covers any of it yet.** No test refers to the logo, the header navigation or the footer. Existing tests only check the \"Our Products\" heading and the home page's other links to the catalogue.\n- **Test levels:**\n  - `logo-leads-home` is the story's happy path and gets a Playwright browser test.\n  - The other four scenarios get HTTP-level tests in `tests/DcaShop.IntegrationTests`, written like `HomePageTest`.\n- **One mismatch, left open in the plan.** The story belongs to the Portal context, but the header and footer markup lives in the web host, not in `src/DcaShop.Portal`. That follows this repository's rule that views live in the host. The two context maps agree, and the story touches no relationship between contexts.\n\nThe plan also records one open question for the test stage. The browser test's title must match a scenario in the shared specification's `scenarios.md`, and I didn't check whether `logo-leads-home` has one, because that file isn't an input to this stage.\n\nI didn't consult the knowledge catalog. Adopting existing behaviour decides no architecture pattern, so there was nothing to look up.","ttft_ms":4923,"type":"result","duration_ms":80444,"uuid":"bfb0f49a-1a24-4cd2-a283-e23a6ba6cbb1","ttft_stream_ms":3656,"time_to_request_ms":36,"first_content_frame_ms":3656,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
